      "text": "Britney Spears released her debut single, '...Baby One More Time', which became a global hit."
    },
    {
      "date": "1999-01-12",
      "headline": "Debut Album Release",
      "text": "Spears released her debut studio album, '...Baby One More Time', which topped the charts and became one of the best-selling albums of all time."
    },
    {
      "date": "2000-05-16",
      "headline": "Second Album Release",
      "text": "Her second studio album, 'Oops!... I Did It Again', was released and broke the record for the highest debut-week album sales by a female artist."
