      "text": "Spears released her fifth studio album, 'Blackout', which is considered a critical success."
    },
    {
      "date": "2008-12-02",
      "headline": "Sixth Album Release",
      "text": "Her sixth studio album, 'Circus', was released, featuring the hit single 'Womanizer'."
    },
