      "headline": "Convictions",
      "text": "Former Nixon aides G. Gordon Liddy and James W. McCord Jr. were convicted of conspiracy, burglary, and wiretapping in the Watergate incident."
    },
    {
      "date": "1973-04-30",
      "headline": "Resignations and Dismissals",
      "text": "Top Nixon aides H.R. Haldeman and John Ehrlichman resigned, and Attorney General Richard Kleindienst was dismissed amid the growing scandal."
