      "headline": "Earned Law Degree",
      "text": "Kafka received his Doctor of Law degree from the German Charles-Ferdinand University of Prague."
    },
    {
      "date": "1908",
      "headline": "Published First Works",
      "text": "Kafka's first eight stories were published in the literary journal Hyperion under the title 'Betrachtung' (Contemplation)."
    },
    {
      "date": "1912",
      "headline": "Wrote 'The Metamorphosis'",
      "text": "Kafka wrote 'The Metamorphosis', one of his most famous works, which was published in 1915."
    },
    {
