      "date": "1672",
      "headline": "Elected Fellow of the Royal Society",
      "text": "Newton was elected a Fellow of the Royal Society, where he presented his work on light and color."
    },
    {
      "date": "1687",
      "headline": "Publication of Principia Mathematica",
      "text": "Newton published 'Philosophiæ Naturalis Principia Mathematica', laying the foundation for classical mechanics."
    },
    {
      "date": "1696",
      "headline": "Appointed Warden of the Mint",
      "text": "Newton was appointed Warden of the Royal Mint, where he oversaw the recoinage of English currency."
    },
    {
      "date": "1703",
      "headline": "President of the Royal Society",
      "text": "Newton was elected President of the Royal Society, a position he held until his death."
    },
    {
