      "headline": "Publication of Opticks",
      "text": "Newton published 'Opticks', detailing his experiments with light and color and introducing the theory of the particle nature of light."
    },
    {
      "date": "1705",
      "headline": "Knighted by Queen Anne",
      "text": "Newton was knighted by Queen Anne, becoming Sir Isaac Newton."
    },
    {
      "date": "1727-03-31",
      "headline": "Death of Isaac Newton",
