      "headline": "Zoroastrianism in the Achaemenid Empire",
      "text": "Zoroastrianism becomes the state religion of the Achaemenid Empire under the rule of Cyrus the Great and later Darius the Great. The religion influences the empire's administration and culture."
    },
    {
