      "date": "-800",
      "headline": "Development of the Upanishads",
      "text": "The Upanishads, philosophical texts that explore the concepts of Brahman (ultimate reality) and Atman (soul), are developed. They mark a shift from ritualistic practices to philosophical inquiry."
    },
